<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi industrial firm returns to black in H1 97.</title>
<headline>Saudi industrial firm returns to black in H1 97.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				 (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  2.6    vs    14.4 loss</p>
<p> Total income	     13.6    vs     8.3</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  582.8    vs   564.8</p>
<p> Assets		    613.6    vs   601.7</p>
<p>Full Name: National Industrialisation Company.</p>
<p>Note - A group of Saudi investors, including businessman Prince al-Waleed bin Talal, in 1996 bought a 50 percent stake in the firm which is traded on the Saudi market. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
